            <ArticleTitle>Post-pyeloplasty flank pain treated with laparoscopically-assisted renal autotransplantation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2459-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Despite excellent overall results, some patients continue to experience flank pain post-pyeloplasty. For the first time, we report the successful use of laparoscopically-assisted renal autotransplantation in the treatment of refractory flank pain post-pyeloplasty.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
